msgctxt "1088"
msgid "Thank you for shopping with us. You must really like gelato!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"It must be getting more popular nowadays. We've been getting a lot more "
"older gentlemen and businessmen on their way home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"But... those men usually have women or their subordinates buy it for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid ""
"Too embarrassed to buy it themselves, I suppose... But they can't resist "
"their love of gelato in the end!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid ""
"(Guess even hardened businessmen love gelato. I should remember this when "
"I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "(No point eating now. I'm not even hungry.)"
msgstr "(Inutile mangiare adesso. Non ho neanche fame.)"

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Sorry, something came up."
msgstr "Mi dispiace, è saltato fuori un imprevisto."

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "All right, then. Please come again."
msgstr "Perfetto. Torni a trovarci."

